dsh-gloss

This package bundles an offline English dictionary compiled from:

  ECDICT — https://github.com/skywind3000/ECDICT
  Copyright (C) 2021 skywind3000
  Licensed under the MIT License

  The full upstream lexicon is 770,611 entries (66 MB). This package ships a
  filtered subset of 17,397 entries (~406 KB gzip) covering Oxford core words,
  the top 20,000 frequency words, and CET-4/CET-6/GK/KY exam vocabulary.

  Field layout per entry: [word, phonetic, primary definition, part of speech].

